Grammar

    0 $accept: complete_commands $end

    1 complete_commands: complete_commands separator list
    2                  | list

    3 list: pipeline
    4     | list AND_IF linebreak pipeline
    5     | list OR_IF linebreak pipeline

    6 pipeline: command
    7         | pipeline PIPE linebreak command

    8 command: simple_command
    9        | subshell
   10        | subshell redirect_list

   11 subshell: OPAR compound_list CPAR

   12 compound_list: linebreak term
   13              | linebreak term separator

   14 term: term separator list
   15     | list

   16 simple_command: cmd_prefix cmd_word cmd_suffix
   17               | cmd_prefix cmd_word
   18               | cmd_prefix
   19               | cmd_name cmd_suffix
   20               | cmd_name

   21 cmd_name: WORD

   22 cmd_word: WORD

   23 cmd_prefix: io_redirect
   24           | cmd_prefix io_redirect

   25 cmd_suffix: io_redirect
   26           | cmd_suffix io_redirect
   27           | WORD
   28           | cmd_suffix WORD

   29 redirect_list: io_redirect
   30              | redirect_list io_redirect

   31 io_redirect: io_file
   32            | io_here

   33 io_file: LESS filename
   34        | GREAT filename
   35        | DGREAT filename

   36 filename: WORD

   37 io_here: DLESS here_end

   38 here_end: WORD

   39 separator: NEWLINE
   40          | separator NEWLINE

   41 linebreak: separator
   42          | ε


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    error (256)
    WORD (258) 21 22 27 28 36 38
    NEWLINE (259) 39 40
    PIPE (260) 7
    LESS (261) 33
    GREAT (262) 34
    DLESS (263) 37
    DGREAT (264) 35
    AND_IF (265) 4
    OR_IF (266) 5
    OPAR (267) 11
    CPAR (268) 11


